tweet_ids":["2115991929783824700"],"id":"2115991929783824700","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":6655,"like_count":18,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2115991020760604743","type":"quoted"}],"text":"Binance 被倒追踪⑪\n\nFirst Digital 已将持有约 340 万美元 FDUSD 的攻击者地址列入黑名单。 https://t.co/XeQZONWbjP","url":"https://x.com/Bitwux/status/2115991929783824700"},{"author_id":"39941478","created_at":"2026-10-30T02:16:14.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115991133159387348"],"id":"2115991133159387348","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":32074,"like_count":35,"quote_count":3,"reply_count":5,"retweet_count":5},"text":"全球最大加密货币交易所币安（Binance）疑似遭黑客攻击，平台一度暂停提款及部分交易服务。截至最新消息，币安已冻结约30亿美元（约38亿3400万新元）的相关加密资产。 https://t.co/mM7hyxIg4R","url":"https://x.com/zaobaosg/status/2115991133159387348"},{"author_id":"1461224994705649671","created_at":"2026-10-30T02:16:04.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115991091447259309"],"id":"2115991091447259309","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":10290,"like_count":52,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":23,"retweet_count":7},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2115981828339458082","type":"quoted"}],"text":"过去十年，OKX 持续构建多层安全防护，也始终保持警惕。\n\n我们呼吁行业共建更严格的标准，强化地址与权限验证、风险操作的签名层防护、实时预警与可疑资金协同处置，并共同应对量子计算以及 AI 带来的新的安全挑战。\n\n守护用户与行业信任，需要每一家机构一起行动。 https://t.co/ae4xPGTc6Q","url":"https://x.com/okxchinese/status/2115991091447259309"},{"author_id":"825183199198212096","created_at":"2026-10-30T02:13:54.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115990547454365803"],"id":"2115990547454365803","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":20,"impression_count":15111,"like_count":44,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":10,"retweet_count":9},"text":"Binance 被盗追踪 🔟\n\nBinance 热钱包安全事件：流程、攻击逻辑与阶段性复盘：数十亿美元是怎么被黑客转走的？\n\n根据目前公开的链上分析，涉及多个热钱包的异常资金流出规模可能达到 55—60 亿美元。如果最终确认，这可能成为加密行业历史上规模最大的盗币事件。 https://t.co/k4T2oJmxvc","url":"https://x.com/Bitwux/status/2115990547454365803"},{"author_id":"1154174763918606339","created_at":"2026-1